stated that the new sanctions are intended to leverage recent Ukrainian successes on the battlefield to force an end to the conflict."},"groundingChunkIndices": [1,0]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 664,"endIndex": 871,"text": "*   **Immigration Executive Orders:** President Trump signed new orders targeting birthright citizenship and \"birth tourism\" as part of a broader administration effort to tighten entry and citizenship rules."},"groundingChunkIndices": [2]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 872,"endIndex": 1042,"text": "*   **Approval Rating Lows:** A new KSTP/SurveyUSA poll reported that both President Trump and Governor Tim Walz have hit new approval rating lows among Minnesota voters."},"groundingChunkIndices": [0,1]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 1043,"endIndex": 1224,"text": "*   **New York City Housing:** Mayor Zohran Mamdani broke ground on a massive affordable housing initiative aimed at building 50,000 new homes across more than 100 city-owned sites."},"groundingChunkIndices": [3]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 1225,"endIndex": 1411,"text": "*   **Tech and Censorship:** Meta (Instagram) restricted a report by *The Hindu* regarding a Kashmir pellet gun victim in India, citing local legal requirements under India’s IT rules."},"groundingChunkIndices": [4]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 2261,"endIndex": 2538,"text": "*   *The Washington Post*: [\"Latest From The Post - August 8, 2026\"](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHvr6w4f-bU8Ryga6P3M9X8DGLJcjNbDIrmoZYtoYwHZqNBMDjIp-Y7Sk9WYZF5MEe8QrppA_yzg2zYRcOrTX-4XcR91IuxP5i65JeTF8-_bDpQ9l_jhYe3SzKbnVjHIWRbNLKuQ4w=)"},"groundingChunkIndices": [5]}],"webSearchQueries": ["top news headlines August 8 2026","current major news headlines August 8 2026","today's breaking news August 8 2026"]}}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 73,"candidatesTokenCount": 909,"totalTokenCount": 2359,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 73}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 1377,"serviceTier": "standard"},"